WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.954 --> 00:00:04.668
New here? Choose Start here. Sage will guide you at your pace.

2
00:00:04.668 --> 00:00:08.729
Recommended: follow the avatar. Or watch the videos before trying.

3
00:00:08.729 --> 00:00:15.307
First, click Settings. Check your name, reminder email, and currencies.

4
00:00:15.307 --> 00:00:21.896
Next, click Tasks. Start with one small task and a clear due date.

5
00:00:21.896 --> 00:00:28.488
In Money, record income first, then expenses. Check the currency each time.

6
00:00:28.488 --> 00:00:34.556
Return to Overview. Today is your daily starting point.

7
00:00:34.556 --> 00:00:38.118
Finish when ready. Reopen Start here any time for the tour or videos.
